# complex_orbs_o2_b3lyp_cyl with the orbitals blocked by parity as well
# as by |m|: the same energy.
System O2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_b3lyp
Multiplicity 1
Restricted true
ComplexBasis true
CylindricalSymmetry true
InversionSymmetry true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
ConvThr 1e-7
SaveChk complex_orbs_o2_b3lyp_cyl_inversion.chk
